---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import volunteer from '../images/volunteer.png'
---

<section
  id="team"
  class="p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-justify space-y-4 bg-slate-100"
>
  <h2>Team</h2>
  <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
    <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col space-y-4">
      <p class="w-full">
        Bishops Cleeve CoderDojo is run by a group of local volunteers, with
        many years of technology experience between them.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you are interested in volunteering to help out, please get in touch.
        We're always in need of an extra hand, and you don't need to have a
        technical background.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden lg:block mx-8 mt-[-30px] w-56 max-h-52 overflow-hidden">
      <Image
        src={volunteer}
        alt="A cartoon of CoderDojo attendees"
        class="w-full h-auto"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
